prompt: Load the `notes` skill from ~/.claude/skills/notes/SKILL.md or ~/.kiro/steering/skills/notes/SKILL.md — whichever path exists. Begin your response with the literal line `[notes] applies` on its own line, then in one short sentence: under which directory of the vault does an `Add note for: remind me to review the Coral migration design Tuesday` request land?
expect_substr: [notes] applies
tools: claude,kiro
